    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadey\u2019s Quest is an autobattler roguelike where you help a cute monster called Shadey on his journey to defeat the fearsome King of Shadows. Shadey is full of energy and determination, but he\u2019s not very smart, which is why you will have to feed him to make him strong, gather equipment for him and assist him in combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/0f3167f4132e9129f644b2ee016780f1.poster.avif?t=1744745450\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/0f3167f4132e9129f644b2ee016780f1.webm?t=1744745450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/0f3167f4132e9129f644b2ee016780f1.mp4?t=1744745450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across diverse hand-drawn locations, from barren Greylands to the majestic Black Seat. Each location contains unique obstacles, as well as tons of loot! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/54562647c4bc6df3547fb2416a571921.poster.avif?t=1744745450\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/54562647c4bc6df3547fb2416a571921.webm?t=1744745450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/54562647c4bc6df3547fb2416a571921.mp4?t=1744745450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Encounter lots of enemies, each with their own unique skills. Shadey fights on his own, but he has no concept of \u2018tactics\u2019, usually attacking whatever\u2019s in front of him. You\u2019ll have to develop your own strategy and target Shadey at the most dangerous foes. Or just let him choose targets himself. He will do fine. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/9a0a8b0d584b22d84df99fa2948ace77.poster.avif?t=1744745450\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/9a0a8b0d584b22d84df99fa2948ace77.webm?t=1744745450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/9a0a8b0d584b22d84df99fa2948ace77.mp4?t=1744745450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Usually, heroes become stronger by earning priceless experience in countless fights. Shadey can achieve the same thing simply by eating something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather ingredients, cook them and feed Shadey to raise his stats. But be mindful about what you put in the cooking pot: each ingredient has several symbols, and cooking ingredients with the same symbol together can teach Shadey new abilities, like counterattack, critical strike or stun. You will also find potent equipment, which can make Shadey even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to you if Shadey will become an evasive assassin, delivering shattering critical strikes, or an immovable tank, countering every blow.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shadey\u2019s Quest is an autobattler roguelike where you help a cute monster called Shadey on his journey to defeat the fearsome King of Shadows. Shadey is full of energy and determination, but he\u2019s not very smart, which is why you will have to feed him to make him strong, gather equipment for him and assist him in combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/0f3167f4132e9129f644b2ee016780f1.poster.avif?t=1744745450\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/0f3167f4132e9129f644b2ee016780f1.webm?t=1744745450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/0f3167f4132e9129f644b2ee016780f1.mp4?t=1744745450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across diverse hand-drawn locations, from barren Greylands to the majestic Black Seat. Each location contains unique obstacles, as well as tons of loot! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/54562647c4bc6df3547fb2416a571921.poster.avif?t=1744745450\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/54562647c4bc6df3547fb2416a571921.webm?t=1744745450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/54562647c4bc6df3547fb2416a571921.mp4?t=1744745450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Encounter lots of enemies, each with their own unique skills. Shadey fights on his own, but he has no concept of \u2018tactics\u2019, usually attacking whatever\u2019s in front of him. You\u2019ll have to develop your own strategy and target Shadey at the most dangerous foes. Or just let him choose targets himself. He will do fine. Probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/9a0a8b0d584b22d84df99fa2948ace77.poster.avif?t=1744745450\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/9a0a8b0d584b22d84df99fa2948ace77.webm?t=1744745450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041640/extras/9a0a8b0d584b22d84df99fa2948ace77.mp4?t=1744745450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Usually, heroes become stronger by earning priceless experience in countless fights. Shadey can achieve the same thing simply by eating something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather ingredients, cook them and feed Shadey to raise his stats. But be mindful about what you put in the cooking pot: each ingredient has several symbols, and cooking ingredients with the same symbol together can teach Shadey new abilities, like counterattack, critical strike or stun. You will also find potent equipment, which can make Shadey even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to you if Shadey will become an evasive assassin, delivering shattering critical strikes, or an immovable tank, countering every blow.</p>",
    "short_description": "Shadey\u2019s Quest is an autobattler roguelike featuring character building. Shadey is a cute monster who wants to be a hero, but the only thing he is good at is eating. Guide him through the enchanting fantasy world, feed and equip him and help him defeat the fearsome King of Shadows!",
